==========================================================================
  PART 3: Clean-garbage lemma — qs3_sim = qs3_ref
==========================================================================

  The critical semantic claim: on every |π⟩ ∈ P_3, qs3_sim's action
  on the target is f_{π(3)} ∘ f_{π(2)} ∘ f_{π(1)} and the dummies
  return to their initial state (because f_i² = I here).
  Equivalently: qs3_sim = qs3_ref where qs3_ref applies the composed
  target unitary per π directly (via `control` on S_3), leaving dummies
  untouched. Full 7-qubit unitary equality:

  ✓ qs3_sim  =  qs3_ref  (clean-garbage lemma across all 6 permutations) (fidelity=1.000000)

